Description:You control Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth, a Swamp and three Mountains, have Extraplanar Lens and Blaze in hand and {C}{C}{C} in your mana pool. The opponent is at 7 life. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-82384a118b1b83a9 | Urborg gives every land the Swamp type but not the name (CR 205.3, 201.2): Extraplanar Lens adds mana only for lands named like the exiled card, so imprint a Mountain (the other two give two each: six mana, Blaze for 5), not the Swamp
